<title>USA: Anchor Gaming says CFO MiMascio resigns.</title>
<headline>Anchor Gaming says CFO MiMascio resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anchor Gaming said Monday its Chief Financial Officer Sal DiMascio resigned Friday, and it will begin its search for a replacement immediately.</p>
<p>The company did not provide further information.</p>
<p>Anchor Gaming operates gaming machines and casinos.</p>
